sentences.text:
The sum and substance of the arguments addressed by revisionist (who argued the petition in person) is as under:-
(i) That the ingredients of the offences charged are neither constituted by facts or evidence on record;
(ii) That no evidence was brought on record to prove that he was posted in the concerned office of SDM;
(iii) That the Ld. Trial Court failed to appreciate that prosecution has failed to prove that revisionist was in conspiracy with any other co-accused ;
6.

